# Updater signing key -- NEVER commit this. Losing it just means you can't
# sign new updates; leaking it means anyone can sign a malicious update that
# every installed copy of the app will trust and auto-install. Keep
# nzyselle-updater.key and .keypassword.txt in a password manager instead.
updater-keys/
